OL,3,GNEWSAYouth theatre group 'like a
OL,4,Afamily' marks 50 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA theatre group described by members as
OL,7,F"like a family" is celebrating 50 years
OL,8,Fof treading the boards and wants all
OL,9,Fthose who have been involved to share
OL,10,Fmemories.
OL,12,FShottery Youth Theatre began in 1976 as
OL,13,Fa way of giving young people in the
OL,14,Fdistrict of Stratford-upon-Avon,
OL,15,Fsomething to do during the winter.
OL,17,FA panto has been staged every year
OL,18,Fsince, with only one missed because of
OL,19,Fthe Covid pandemic, and now they want
OL,20,Fto get in touch with as many of the
OL,21,Fpeople who've taken part over the last
OL,22,Ffive decades as possible.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
