OL,3,GNEWSAYouth theatre group 'like a
OL,4,Afamily' marks 50 years
OL,5,
OL,6,F"The amount of people that say to me,
OL,7,F'I used to be in it', and it's just
OL,8,Flovely to feel that we're still
OL,9,Fcarrying that on," said Rachel Rose,
OL,10,Fwriter and director.
